    {
      "text": "I've not really had much of an update for you, Andy.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 71.56,
      "end_time": 73.88
    },
    {
      "text": "I know that we've got Basis next week, which I'm looking forward to.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 74.84,
      "end_time": 77.72
    },
    {
      "text": "I didn't know if we're going to receive one of those briefing forms.",
