    },
    {
      "text": "For creating work.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 83.01,
      "end_time": 83.81
    },
    {
      "text": "I think I can see quite a good fit, to be honest.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 83.81,
      "end_time": 88.57
    },
    {
      "text": "I think they look really quite up our straza.",
